  "id": "vegetable-noodle-bowls",
  "name": "Vegetable Noodle Bowls",
  "subtitle": "Tender vegetables and spaghetti in a savory sesame finish",
  "description": "A quick skillet meal combining crisp-tender vegetables, seasoned noodles, and toasted sesame seeds.",
